settled Matthias 2026-11-07: bar 4, A (Hill 1915) has A4:2 C5:2 C5:4 and leaves out the A4 sixteenth that carries verse 2's "And", B (Wier 1918) keeps it inside the bar, A4:2 C5:2 C5:3 A4:1; bar 7, A has G4:2 G4:2 A4:3 G4:1 (dotted), B G4:2 G4:2 A4:2 G4:2 (even); Zitro plays the old print's version (Hill 1915), and a crop of A's scan confirmed A.
